f the  cube or scp-076-2  scp-076-1 is a 3-meter cube of black  metamorphic stone covered in patterned  engravings that have not been matched to  any known civilization analysis via  radioisotope suggests that the cube is  at least 10 000 years old though an  exact date of origin could not be  determined there is a door on one side  sealed with a lock surrounded by 20  smaller locks all arranged in a circular  pattern the foundation has not been able  to locate any of the keys and therefore  is unable to lock the door this is  unfortunate given the nature of the  figure that lurks inside the cube  chained inside of a stone coffin this is  the resting place of scp-076-2  also known as abel abel is a humanoid  male who appears to be in his late 20s  with black hair gray eyes and olive skin  in spite of his youthful appearance his  age is estimated to be around the same  as the cube that holds him his body is  covered in tattoos depicting various  occult icons and images of demonic faces  not uncommon for warrior castes of old  when he is encased in his coffin within  his stone prison abel is technically  dead and registers no vital signs of any  kind however he does not stay dead on an  occasional basis with no apparent cause  he will wake up and reanimate once he is  awake and aware he will attempt to leave  the cube by any means necessary if he  manages to escape he will look for the  nearest human being and attempt to kill  them once he has latched on to a target  he will enter a rage state that will not  stop until he is killed though as his  anomalous nature implies this death is  never permanent and he will always  awaken again eventually terminating abel  in order to stop one of his rampages is  often difficult as he possesses strength  and durability far beyond the  capabilities of an ordinary man he has  superhuman power and speed and though  his physical body can be damaged he does  not appear to respond to pain and  continues to fight through extreme  injuries that would take most targets  down during his time in foundation  custody he has displayed the following  abilities over the course of four  minutes while trying to attack a  research assistant that happened to  cross into his line of sight moments  before he ripped through a reinforced  steel security door with his bare hands  breaking the steel apart as if it were  layers of tin foil during another  incident he was able to run a distance  of 64 meters in under three seconds to  catch up to an armored van filled with  foundation guards while security staff  attempted to neutralize him during the  same incident he took several 50-caliber  rounds to the head and continued to move  and kill for several minutes after in  spite of having literal holes in his  head and missing portions of vital brain  matter during another escape he got a  hold of a piece of steel rebar which he  used to swap bullets from handguns and  assault rifles out of the air like he  was batting a ball with a tennis racquet  during another attempted escape after  killing half a dozen d-classes along the  way foundation staff were eventually  able to trap the entity in a vat of  water sealing the top where he tread  water furiously for an hour before  eventually suffocating this suggests  that unlike most people who will  asphyxiate after only a few minutes  without oxygen he can survive for at  least an hour the most notable of his  anomalous skills however is his ability  to produce weapons usually bladed from  thin air whenever he wants to slow down  security footage has shown that he does  this by pulling the weapons out of a  tiny rift in space a portal to another  dimension of some kind it is unsure  where this portal leads to or how able  accesses it but it appears to function  as his own personal armory stocked with  an endless supply of black non-reflected  bladed weapons which vanish as soon as  they leave his grasp though it is  difficult and often dangerous to do so  able can in fact be killed some  previously affected methods of  termination have included fire from  multiple heavy caliber machine guns  suffocation being crushed between a 13.6  metric ton piece of elevator equipment  cremation via grenade placed inside of a  cavity in his chest and the detonation  of an on-site nuclear warhead every time  scp-076-2 is killed his corpse quickly  decays at an unnaturally rapid rate  until he has turned into a pile of dust  then the door to the cube as well as the  coffin inside will slam shut and the  lock on the outside will rotate shut  somehow abel's body will then reform  inside the coffin this process can take  anywhere from six hours to over 20 years  after a series of failed experiments  containment procedures for scp-076 were  amended to the current procedures in  place  scp-076 is placed in containment area  25b located 200 meters below sea level  tunneled into solid bedrock in an area  with limited seismic activity the only  way to access this area is via an  elevator shaft which is broken up every  50 meters with a reinforced blast door  made of shielding that is 20 centimeters  thick when the elevator shaft is not  being used it is flooded with seawater  the containment area includes an outer  security perimeter outfitted with  security personnel trained in counter  intrusion and close quarters combat an  administrative and support area where  on-site personnel can live and rest a  primary containment zone filled with  seawater and made of a seven meter cube  encased in reinforced material and then  a killing corridor that is 150 meters in  size with an electrical system able to  deliver a 20 000 volt shock in the event  of an attempted containment breach the  security station at the entrance of the  killing corridor must be staffed with at  least three armed security guards at all  times in the event of a containment  breach all staff on site must go to the  closest security station immediately for  weapons and armor the staff will remain  at alert condition 1 until able has been  neutralized and recontained if 90  minutes pass after a full breach without  the order to stand down being given the  entire facility will be flooded with  seawater and the access shaft will be  sealed for 24 hours this is considered  an extreme measure as it will kill any  site staff present but desperate times  call for desperate measures after the  containment procedures were amended and  file updated doctor rejected submitted a  complaint to director maria jones head  of record keeping and information  security administration the  correspondence reads as follows i have  to go on record as saying that i  seriously object to the proposed  revisions of the scp-076 special  containment procedures file i know that  redact all important stuff already  claims it as a security risk but you and  i both know it's just top brass trying  to sweep their biggest and most  embarrassing mistake ever under the rug  omega 7 happened it existed those people  died because you screwed up and you  can't change that no matter how hard you  tried to hide it for god's sake man  those people guarding him deserve to  know exactly what he is and what he did  what we  did how we screwed up so they'll know  better so what was omega-7 what could  have possibly constituted one of the  foundation's worst greatest most  humiliating mistakes ever following the  death of an agent whose identity has  been redacted who had managed to best  able several times in combat the  foundation became aware of an intriguing  possibility whenever abel encountered  the rare individual he perceived as  superior or at least equal to him in  combat his uncontrollable rage would  subside and he would develop a kind of  respect when abel learned of the man's  death he calmed down and was coherent  enough to interview he was distressed at  the death which had occurred as  collateral damage in an airstrike  intended to contain another scp he  explained his feelings on the subject a  man like that deserves to die in combat  so close to his opponent he can feel his  breath not in some destruction ordered  by cowardly kings and princes safe in  their palaces the rest of you you  disgust me i don't even have the urge to  strike you down after this interview the  researcher who conducted it recommended  that the foundation attempt to find a  way to work with abel and somehow  militarize him in accordance with the  beau commission's desire to use as cp  objects for tactical purposes a mobile  task force was proposed referred to as  omega 7 or by its nickname pandora's box  task force omega 7 was to consist of  between 10 and 20 field agents split up  into teams of three and five people each  members of these teams have selected a  roster of highly qualified field agents  and chosen by abel himself their purpose  would be to provide support to him  during high-risk fieldwork and  based situations abel was outfitted with  a device attached to his neck that if it  was triggered or interfered with in any  way would detonate and destroy his  spinal cord trachea and the major blood  vessels of his neck killing him  instantly a tracking device was also  attached to abel in order to keep the  foundation informed of his whereabouts  at all times abel was instructed to  refrain from any unnecessary killing or  violence and only attack when ordered to  this operation was off to a bit of a  rocky start and the head researcher in  charge of it added this addendum to the  initial project proposal for god's sake  find these guys something to do abel's  getting bored and starting putting his  team through live fire exercises they  get bullets he gets training weapons  have you ever seen someone break a man's  jaw using a nerf sword he's not gonna  stop until someone gets killed indeed  abel was getting restless and the  foundation needed to find a way to keep  him busy until he could be occupied with  bloodier pursuits this project report  was submitted regarding abel's  activities in light of  scp-076-2's proficient use of the  sumerian language researchers have asked  it to translate several documents while  it originally replied with disinterest  it has translated some of the documents  it found worthy of its attention most of  the documents chosen by  scp-076-2 were regarding battles or  legendary heroes one of its favorites in  particular being the epic of gilgamesh  however one researcher presented it with  the symbol from scp-073  upon sight of this  scp-076-2 became highly enraged killing  several of the researchers before its  kill switch could be activated when  revived in question about this  scp-076-2 responded aggressively and  that line of questioning was immediately  dropped it is recommended anything  pertaining to scp-073 never be brought  to the attention of scp-076-2  and that the two are never to be in the  same facility eventually the chance to  see omega-7 in action came about enable  and his task force were deployed at the  request of the boa commission though  details have been redacted from the  official file the mission was deemed a  success and general beau thanked the  research team in an email with the  subject line a job well done he wrote  excellent work doctor the mission went  exactly as expected we'll be calling you  again if we need your help this new  chapter of the project bred discord  between the two lead researchers  assigned to abel from here on referred  to as dr w and dr p  dr p was highly in favor of omega 7 and  its military applications while dr w  strongly disproved believing the project  to be an example of the military forcing  the scp foundation to do its dirty work  he responded to the general's  congratulations with a strongly worded  email to his colleague too strongly  worded to repeat here to summarize it  neatly he was very upset following this  email and at dr p's request dr w was  reassigned to scp-682  leaving him as the sole researcher in  charge of the 